dorff path-connected Mathlib `CWComplex` X with `G ≃* FundamentalGroup X x` and a contractible covering space, which is the standard meaning.","reading":"reading:92c05cece9ac8cdc046dad81","source_term":"full","state":"all"}],"readings":["reading:349f2ccc5de277f657e936b7","reading:92c05cece9ac8cdc046dad81"],"state":"agree"},"readings":[{"availability":"recorded","credit":{"atlas_pin":"598384f431d532144d03cbabd1c5b384e1610218","authors":[{"handle":"carlostoledo1891","name":"Carlos Toledo"}],"kind":"third-party-reported","license":"MIT","method":"Every Comparator challenge re-run on Linux with nanoda switched on, decided by a preregistered rule; every family's challenge statements read against OpenAI's headline, clause by clause. Decider: Comparator (leanprover/comparator d03acab1 = tag v4.34.0, built with the release's toolchain v4.34.1), lean4export 076e8e57, landrun 811cfff5, nanoda_lib 3a240721 — on GitHub's Linux runners (.github/workflows/openai-math-kernel.yml), one j","name":"Carlos Toledo, cert-machine","pin":"9814e4c06281e34a113ce853d7d99ccce160b750","repository":"https://github.com/carlostoledo1891/cert-machine","source":"cert-machine","url":"https://carlostoledo.co/reports/openai-math.html"},"id":"reading:349f2ccc5de277f657e936b7","pair_review":false,"review_state":"outside-report","source":"cert-machine","source_term":"MATCHES","source_value":{"code":"MATCHES","confidence":"high","disagreement":null,"gap":null,"openai_note_on_gap":"no gap","second_reading":null,"text":"The challenge statements state the headline as OpenAI wrote it.","url":"https://github.com/carlostoledo1891/cert-machine/blob/9814e4c06281e34a113ce853d7d99ccce160b750/certs/openai-math-statements.json","verdict":"matches"},"source_verdict":"matches","state":"all","target":"f:196","target_kind":"family-headline"},{"availability":"recorded","credit":{"atlas_pin":"598384f431d532144d03cbabd1c5b384e1610218","authors":[{"name":"MathVet maintainers"}],"kind":"third-party-reported","license":"Apache